  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC AEDO Exam Cancelled Notice 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-04T17:21:43+05:30\">May 4, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">5:21 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a></strong> has released the <strong>Exam Cancelled Notice</strong>\u00a0on its official website for the recruitment of <strong data-end=\"333\" data-start=\"283\">Assistant Education Development Officer (AEDO)</strong> posts. The exam was conducted on <strong data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"371\">14, 15, 17, 18, 20, and 21 April 2026 (Cancelled)</strong>. The <strong data-end=\"446\" data-start=\"418\">BPSC application process</strong> started on <strong data-end=\"478\" data-start=\"458\">05 December 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until <strong data-end=\"560\" data-start=\"540\">12 December 2025</strong>. Candidates will able to check their <strong>Exam Cancelled Notice</strong>\u00a0using their <strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"633\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the portal. The direct link will be provided below. <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt. No. 87/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a